# Worker-only connector secrets (tenant-scoped). Copy to worker.secrets.env
# (git-ignored) and fill in. Injected into the `worker` service ONLY.
#
# Format: NLW_SECRET_<TENANT_UUID_HEX>_<SECRET_REF>=value
#   - TENANT_UUID_HEX = the workspace/tenant UUID with dashes removed, UPPERCASE
#   - SECRET_REF matches ^[A-Z][A-Z0-9_]{0,63}$ (the connector's secret_ref)
#
# Example (tenant 0123abcd-...-ef, secret_ref STATIC_DEMO):
# NLW_SECRET_0123ABCD0000000000000000000000EF_STATIC_DEMO=the-secret-value
